From c5de2c27b07e9f63600a88bdeeef912c23155da1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:19:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: enable arm-wdt on STM32MP1 ST boards

Enable the arm_wdt on STM32MP1x boards. Set default timeout
to 32 seconds.

Change-Id: Iea2b010955f68a5f1cce146e06c0ccf4b14b247c
Signed-off-by: Lionel Debieve <lionel.debieve@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
